     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The format in master is compatible with md5sum/shasum (see ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/bagit-java/commit/27832c1110e3b724d55e9da622a8c3c9db1a8bf9#diff-532a7a3929918490a426c42047e7b688)"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/bagit-java/commit/27832c1110e3b724d55e9da622a8c3c9db1a8bf9#diff-532a7a3929918490a426c42047e7b688)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ".  So this will be resolved when we can update to a new version.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The current plan is for a 5.0 release in a few months.  So I've asked if they could make an updated beta release so we can use it in our release before then.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
