      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The format in master is compatible with md5sum/shasum (see <a href=\"https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/bagit-java/commit/27832c1110e3b724d55e9da622a8c3c9db1a8bf9#diff-532a7a3929918490a426c42047e7b688\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/bagit-java/commit/27832c1110e3b724d55e9da622a8c3c9db1a8bf9#diff-532a7a3929918490a426c42047e7b688</a>).  So this will be resolved when we can update to a new version.</p>\n\n<p>The current plan is for a 5.0 release in a few months.  So I've asked if they could make an updated beta release so we can use it in our release before then.</p>",
