  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>The manifest-SHA.txt produced by the Bag export is not compatible with command-line shasum.  When I try to validate the files in the manifest with shasum, I get the following error:</p>\n\n<p>$ shasum -c manifest-SHA1.txt <br/>\nshasum: manifest-SHA1.txt: no properly formatted SHA1 checksum lines found</p>\n\n<p>The BagIt spec for manifest files may not be compatible with shasum, but if it is, then we should make them compatible for ease of validation.</p>",
